 also including texts by Augustine, Caesarius of Arles, Defensor (Liber scintillarum), Jerome, Gregory the Great, Eucherius (Formulae spiritalis intelligentiae) and many other authors. Near the end is an incomplete copy of the life story of St. Dionysius.</dc:description><dc:format>571 pp., 27 x 16-16.5 cm</dc:format><dc:identifier>doi:10.5076/e-codices-csg-0230</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/csg/0230</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 230</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>e-codices - Virtual Manuscript Library of Switzerland</dc:publisher><dc:language>Latin</dc:language><dc:relation>Scherrer Gustav, Verzeichniss der Handschriften der Stiftsbibliothek von St. Gallen, Halle 1875, S. 83-84.</dc:relation><dc:rights>e-codices / St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek (cf. http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/about/terms)</dc:rights><dc:source rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/csg/0230"></dc:source><dc:title>St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 230 : Manuscript compilation: texts and excerpts from the works of Isidore of Seville, Augustine, Caesarius of Arles, Defensor (Liber scintillarum), Jerome, Gregory the Great, Eucherius (Formulae spiritalis intelligentiae) etc.</dc:title><dc:type>Manuscript</dc:type><dcterms:medium>Parchment</dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_csg_0230"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/9200211/en_list_one_csg_0230"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><edm:EuropeanaAggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_csg_0230"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_csg_0230"/><edm:datasetName>9200211_Ag_EU_e-Codices</edm:datasetName><edm:country>Switzerland</edm:country><edm:preview rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/loris/csg/csg-023